menu "esp32-logcat demo"

    config LOGCAT_TIMING_SWEEP
        bool "Timing sweep at boot (#13/#14)"
        default n
        help
            Runs the timing measurement once per boot: a 1 kHz critical task while the log
            load goes through phases. It writes ~2 MB to flash and pushes out the logs kept
            there, so it is off in the normal build. Enable it with sdkconfig.timing
            (see the project's CMakeLists.txt).

endmenu
